" volee   1 Hierarchy   2 Network   3 Repos   4 Timeline              ? 2 · ✉ 5 · ! 2 need you · ▸ 6 working · 12 agents "
"╭ Agents ────────────╭ Keys · esc closes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮────────────────────╮"
"│▌v ! invoice-tools  │ Everywhere                                                                 │                    │"
"│    needs you · mcp-│   '               jump to an agent: press ' then its letter                │                    │"
"│ s ! invoice-schema │   -               back to the agent selected before                        │                    │"
"│    needs you · bill│   /               filter agents by name, repository, branch or mission     │fra ──────────────╮ │"
"│ x ▸ explore-traces │   m               write a message to the selected agent                    │dle · 25 min      │ │"
"│    working · gatewa│   d               show the selected agent's changes                        │──────────────────╯ │"
"│ e ▸ explore-handler│   a               take over the selected agent in this terminal            │oken-links ─── ⠹ ─╮ │"
"│    working · gatewa│   z               show the selected agent's screen full size               │orking · 18 min   │ │"
"│ r ▸ trace-search   │   i               your messages, questions waiting for you first           │──────────────────╯ │"
"│    working · search│   o               open the selected agent's worktree in your editor, diff  │                    │"
"│ g ▸ trace-gateway  │   n               launch an agent in a new worktree                        │                    │"
"│    working · gatewa│   N               create a mission, which launches its coordinator         │                    │"
"│ b ▸ broken-links   │   F               forget the selected agent: stop listing it (asks first)  │                    │"
"│    working · websit│   A               adopt the selected agent into a volee host, so that you  │                    │"
"│ t ▸ tower          │   5               show the agents in volee hosts as a wall of live screens │                    │"
"│    working · platfo│   tab             focus the next panel                                     │                    │"
"│ p ✓ invoice-page   │   shift-tab       focus the previous panel                                 │                    │"
"│    done · dashboard│   1               show the hierarchy                                       │                    │"
"│ l · latency-audit  │   2               show the network                                         │                    │"
"│    idle · ◆ Latency│   3               show repositories and worktrees                          │                    │"
"│ n · invoicing      │   4               show the timeline                                        │                    │"
"│    idle · ◆ Invoici│   ?               show or hide the keys                                    │                    │"
"│ i · infra          │   esc             close, cancel or go back (never quits)                   │                    │"
